Feral Warfare ideas
-------------------------------------------------------

WIND PARTICLE SYSTEM
    We could probably simulate wind in a more interesting
    way by piping particles in at a particular direction
    into the level, and then bouncing them off surfaces.

    Particle stores direction it's travelling and speed.

    Each particle can have a given radius, anything caught
    in that radius will have the properties of that particle
    applied to it.

DEFORMATION
    Trace a ray from a projectile - determine surface properties.
    If it's marked deformable (i.e., metal), then it will bend away from the direction of the projectile.
    Probably flex the part depending on the amount of surface area at that point -
    so shooting the top or bottom will flex more than shooting the middle.
